{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43062","headline":"经望湖驿 · 韦镒","name":"经望湖驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大漠无屯云，孤峰出乱柳。\n前驱白登道，顾失飞狐口。\n遥忆代王城，俯临恒山後。\n累累多古墓，寂寞爲墟久。\n岂不固金汤，终闻击铜斗。\n交懽初仗信，接讌翻贻咎。\n埋宝贼夫人，磨笄伤彼妇。\n功成行且薄，义立名不朽。\n莫慎纤微端，其何社稷守。\n身殁国遂亡，此立人君丑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦镒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43062.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43062","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}